Z||000000||chris6878||11-27-1999||12:55 AM||||Is there another company that supplies this adapter plate for the small block 350 (besides v8 archie). I seen one previously on a site for $125 i think (it was aluminum).<P>My 85 GT is looking for a v8 swap and i was looking for an adapter plate. Planning on making my own mounts. I have access to a 350 4 bolt main that runs good for $150. I may be able to get this accomplished without putting over  $1000 in it...     thanks for any info on the adapter plate.. i dont want to have to purchase the whole kit..   <P>chris||||reg||5
